  "stem": "In right triangle \\(ABC\\), angle \\(C\\) is a right angle and \\(\\sin A = 0.6\\). What is the value of \\(\\cos B\\)?",
  "figure": null,
  "answer_type": "spr",
  "choices": null,
  "answer": null,
  "spr_answers": [
    "3/5",
    "0.6"
  ],
  "solution": [
    "Angles \\(A\\) and \\(B\\) are complementary, so \\(\\cos B = \\sin(90^{\\circ} - B) = \\sin A\\).",
    "\\(\\cos B = 0.6\\). (Both equal \\(\\frac{BC}{AB}\\).)"
  ],
  "explanation": null,
  "traps": null,
  "verify": "A=asin(Rational(3,5))\nans=simplify(cos(pi/2-A))\nassert ans==Rational(3,5)\nassert all(Rational(s)==ans for s in spr_answers)\n",
